    "created_at": "2016-08-04T08:57:30Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-08-04T08:57:30Z",
    "body": "Are we talking about user-facing errors? Those are not typically exposed as they live in cross-origin documents.\n\nIf we're talking about exceptions coming from Fetch that'd be something else.\n",
