    "created_at": "2016-08-04T09:16:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-08-04T09:16:59Z",
    "body": "I'm talking about user-facing errors. If the browser is deciding which error to show as part of navigation, by returning a generic error in 3.3 we're reducing its usefulness.\n\nOr does this stuff live outside of spec land?\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
    "pin": null,
